---
description: UI, design system and responsiveness
globs: src/pages/**,src/components/**,src/index.css,tailwind.config.js
alwaysApply: false
---
- Reuse primitives from src/components/ui.tsx (Card, Button, Bar, Ring, Input, Select, Modal, Chip, Empty) before creating new ones.
- Follow @docs/08-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md (vaporwave × Win95 × Internet Archive). Tokens: bg, panel, panel2, line, xp (hot pink), cyan, lav, gold (vapor yellow), hp, ok (mint), silver.
- Fonts: font-display (VT323) for titles/numbers, font-sans (IBM Plex Mono) body, font-pixel (Press Start 2P) only for tiny chrome, font-serif for archive/footer text.
- Every content block is a `<Card title="NAME.EXT">` window. Use bevel-out / bevel-in / bevel-btn classes, square corners (no rounded-*).
- Touch-first: tap targets ≥ 40px; taskbar at the bottom on all sizes; modals are bottom sheets on small screens.
- Read data with useLiveQuery; mutate via src/game/engine.ts actions when XP is involved.
- Every list needs an empty state that tells the user what to do next.
- Feedback for every action (toast, ring, animation). Respect prefers-reduced-motion for new animations.
- Destructive actions require confirm().
